1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,158
The trade off.

2
00:00:01,158 --> 00:00:08,515
Asexual reproduction is quick and keeps a good variety exactly as it is, even a seedless banana.

3
00:00:08,515 --> 00:00:13,815
But with no variation, a single disease can wipe out the whole crop.

4
00:00:13,815 --> 00:00:21,250
Sexual reproduction is slower, but it creates variation, the raw material of breeding and of evolution.

